{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>有網民近日公開參加冰島及芬蘭11天高端旅行團的經歷，指每位支付6萬至7萬港元後，遇上酒店衛生、膳食及行程安排等連串問題，全團17人中有多名團友聲稱「中伏」，並向多個部門投訴。原本期待一家人享受奢華旅程，最終卻被事主形容為一場「10日地獄旅行」。</p>\n<h2>貴價團入住酒店仍爆衛生問題</h2>\n<p>事主表示，報團時原以為高昂團費可換來較佳住宿及膳食，惟入住後發現床單懷疑發霉及留有毛粒，部分團友房內更出現血跡、頭髮及上一位住客留下的衛生用品，有人其後出現皮膚過敏，需要服藥。膳食同樣成為爭議焦點，事主指所謂「特色本地美食」份量不足，其中一餐更包括生鯨魚肉及生鹿肉；團友最初獲告知是小牛肉，其後向侍應查詢才得悉真正食材。事主稱有人吃後不適及嘔吐，餘下行程為免再出現問題，只好自費外出用膳，直言整趟旅程是「身心創傷」。</p>\n<h2>藍冰洞縮水兼爆領隊行李爭議</h2>\n<p>旅行團主打的水晶藍冰洞亦被指與宣傳存在落差，團友稱實際只在冰川外圍及洞口附近短暫拍照，未有獲得預期體驗；有人打卡期間滑倒，事主又指領隊未有即時攙扶。其後一個行李箱被遺留在旅遊巴旁，領隊卻懷疑團友把行李漏在酒店房間，更表示翌日順路才取回，令一名年長團友當晚沒有替換衣物。事主同時指控領隊曾向其他人展示私人WhatsApp對話，並涉及不當身體接觸，相關團友已向私隱專員公署及警方求助；至於登機點人數、行李損壞及報失安排，亦成為雙方多次爭執的導火線。</p>\n<h2>旅行社身份終曝光</h2>\n<p>團友返港後向旅遊業監管局、海關、消委會、私隱專員公署及警方等機構作出投訴，並於2026年3月13日聯絡議員辦事處求助，3月16日再向海關舉報。事主起初未有公開旅行社名稱，其後經其他媒體查證及事主開名，確認涉事旅行社為「尊賞假期」。當地承辦商Arctic Adventures於3月25日以電郵回覆，承認體驗與客人預期存在落差，並提出向全團退還20%費用；不過事主稱尊賞假期一直未有聯絡或安排退款，反而向其發出律師信，要求停止相關言論。團友至6月9日再向江旻憓議員助理陳小姐跟進，但稱仍被要求重新提供電郵及檔案編號，多項投訴截至公開事件時仍處於處理階段。</p>\n<h2>網民同情狠批貼錢買難受</h2>\n<p>事件曝光後引起網民熱議，有人形容「唔講以為俾人賣豬仔」，亦有人直斥「貼錢買難受」及「估唔到貴價團也是這樣」。另一名自稱曾參加該旅行社旅行團的網民留言，指抵埗首日連前往酒店附近便利店補給也遇到阻力，形容安排「好無癮」；亦有網民認為冰島自駕遊可自行選擇住宿、膳食及景點「好慘…. 不過做好準備既話，其實去冰島都可以租車自駕自由行，鍾意住乜食乜去邊度￼都可以自己決定」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668130069173_10214157246ae95589f1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"654016714_18060958418430399_1352216433996447792_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668130069173_10214157246ae95589f1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>旅行社單張圖片屬藍冰洞內的景象（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668271519046_11452795226ae9558bd0045.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"654022963_18060958430430399_5222078415855510600_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668271519046_11452795226ae9558bd0045.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>團友稱實際只在冰川外圍及洞口附近短暫拍照（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668470741569_9014739306ae9558d61589.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"656323942_18062072402430399_8912653528242505714_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668470741569_9014739306ae9558d61589.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>旅行團主打的水晶藍冰洞亦被指與宣傳存在落差（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668618838777_5499268726ae9558f067ac.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"654017368_18060958424430399_7730093949465452404_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668618838777_5499268726ae9558f067ac.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>酒店衛生欠佳（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668791396614_8382134076ae955908278a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"655224652_18060971546430399_5478982018860015162_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668791396614_8382134076ae955908278a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>所謂「特色本地美食」份量不足，17個人分圖中食物（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668921037814_11409574846ae95591c40cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"654023065_18060966854430399_8956275461058548428_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367668921037814_11409574846ae95591c40cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>其中一餐膳食包括生鯨魚肉及生鹿肉（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669066524729_10530179536ae955933cba2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"655178947_18060966857430399_5976511161257692156_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669066524729_10530179536ae955933cba2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「全生宴」（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669196365584_10660451846ae95594d88f1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"655597987_18061362950430399_8433137106526895943_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669196365584_10660451846ae95594d88f1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>行李箱被粗暴對待（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669350435785_19051502546ae9559631488.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"655878170_18061362941430399_6188269036254113669_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669350435785_19051502546ae9559631488.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>第二天行李箱碌被抌爛（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669517832507_697707196ae95597d8766.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-11-03 上午11.20.53.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669517832507_697707196ae95597d8766.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>涉事旅行社（圖片來源：尊賞假期官網）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669884143787_15358318266ae9559b6bf41.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"723197152_18077770658430399_6046757918743953846_n.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179367669884143787_15358318266ae9559b6bf41.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>當地承辦商提出向全團退還20%費用（圖片來源：threads@tim_c310）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b0%e5%b3%b6%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冰島旅行團</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%b0%8a%e8%b3%9e%e5%81%87%e6%9c%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">尊賞假期</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e6%8a%95%e8%a8%b4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊投訴</a> </p>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊熱話</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:01.905281+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1503,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:31:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T05:19:27.673040+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:50.662613+00:00","content_hash":"166079fc641852b2ab51ebd6e0a0881808a656c5f37120f4269d90e675a462ff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}